<p>Release a powerful shout, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>physical power 100">197, 266, 318, 363, 403</acronym> physical damage in a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> cone in front of you.</p><p>At level 5 the shout is so strong it shatters all incomming projectiles caught inside.</p><p>The damage increases with your Strength.</p>